    "roll": "5-8",
    "text": "SPACE PIRATES: The starship has been through a disruptor field created by space pirates. They set up these fields along hyperdrive lanes to bring ships to a standstill and whilst the captain is wondering what has gone wrong with the hyper jump they uncloak and attack. Roll on table S – Starships +5 to determine the ship that is attacking and then begin space combat.",
